{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o173b","title":"改元咸熙","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o173b-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"改元咸熙","evidence":["shaodi-e-o173b-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"year":264,"label":"五月甲戌","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y264","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o171","basis":"五月甲戌"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o173b-q","shaodi-q-o171","shaodi-q-o165","shaodi-q-b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o173b-q","source_order":[4,815,"O173b"],"order":1289}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o173b-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-0d498240479dc97aa25b","layer":"original","quote":"夏五月，庚申〖14〗，相国晋王奏复五等爵〖15〗。甲戌〖16〗，改年。癸未〖17〗，追命舞阳宣文侯为晋宣王〖18〗，舞阳忠武侯为晋景王〖19〗。六月，镇西将军卫瓘，上雍州兵于成都县获璧、玉印各一〖20〗；印文似“成信”字。依周成王归禾之义〖21〗，宣示百官，藏于相国府。﹝二﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":222,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":138},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：景元四年（公元 263）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-ef642248e44d01f3825d","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"shaodi-q-o165","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b35fdf03685051716720","layer":"original","quote":"四年春二月〖1〗，复命大将军进位、爵赐，一如前诏。又固辞，乃止。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32},{"id":"shaodi-q-o171","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-cef469d41ec5962b4e48","layer":"original","quote":"咸熙元年春正月，壬戌〖1〗，槛车征邓艾〖2〗。甲子〖3〗，行幸长安。壬申〖4〗，使使者以璧币祀华山〖5〗。是月，钟会反于蜀，为众所讨。邓艾亦见杀。二月，辛卯〖6〗，特赦诸在益土者。庚申〖7〗，葬明元郭后。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":220,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":102}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
